 The Restore Process                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 1 — Find your actual PVC name                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl get pvc -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                                                             
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Example output:                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   NAME                 STATUS   VOLUME   CAPACITY   ACCESSMODES   STORAGECLASS   AGE                                                                                                                              
   outline-docs-pvc     Bound    pvc-xyz  10Gi       RWO           standard       5m                                                                                                                               
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 │ Note the exact PVC name — you'll need it in the next step.                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 2 — Scale Outline down to 0 replicas                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 We do this so Outline isn't reading/writing files while we extract.                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl scale deployment outline-outline --replicas=0 -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                       
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Or if you used Helm:                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   helm upgrade --install outline ./outline -n <your-namespace> --set outline.replicas=0                                                                                                                           
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Wait ~30 seconds for pods to terminate.                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 3 — Create a temporary helper pod                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 This is a clean, safe way to access the data volume without touching the Outline app.                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Save this as restore-pod.yaml:                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```yaml                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   apiVersion: v1                                                                                                                                                                                                  
   kind: Pod                                                                                                                                                                                                       
   metadata:                                                                                                                                                                                                       
     name: outline-restore                                                                                                                                                                                         
     namespace: <your-namespace>    # <-- replace with your namespace                                                                                                                                              
   spec:                                                                                                                                                                                                           
     containers:                                                                                                                                                                                                   
       - name: restore                                                                                                                                                                                             
         image: alpine:3.20                                                                                                                                                                                        
         command: ["sleep", "3600"]                                                                                                                                                                                
         volumeMounts:                                                                                                                                                                                             
           - name: outline-data                                                                                                                                                                                    
             mountPath: /var/lib/outline/data                                                                                                                                                                      
     volumes:                                                                                                                                                                                                      
       - name: outline-data                                                                                                                                                                                        
         persistentVolumeClaim:                                                                                                                                                                                    
           claimName: <your-pvc-name>    # <-- replace with your actual PVC name                                                                                                                                   
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Deploy it:                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl apply -f restore-pod.yaml                                                                                                                                                                               
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Wait for it to be running:                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready pod/outline-restore -n <your-namespace> --timeout=60s                                                                                                                        
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 4 — Copy your tar.gz into the helper pod                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 From the machine that has outline-files.tar.gz:                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl cp ./outline-files.tar.gz outline-restore:/tmp/outline-files.tar.gz -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                 
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 5 — Extract the files into the PVC                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl exec -it outline-restore -n <your-namespace> -- sh -c "cd /var/lib/outline/data && tar xzf /tmp/outline-files.tar.gz"                                                                                   
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Verify the restore worked:                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl exec -it outline-restore -n <your-namespace> -- ls -la /var/lib/outline/data                                                                                                                            
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 You should see your images, PDFs, and any uploads.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 6 — Clean up                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl delete pod outline-restore -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                                          
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ### Step 7 — Scale Outline back up                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   helm upgrade --install outline ./outline -n <your-namespace> --set outline.replicas=2                                                                                                                           
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Or kubectl scale:                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   kubectl scale deployment outline-outline --replicas=2 -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                       
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Pods will start and the PVC will be mounted automatically.                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Full command summary                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   # 1. Find PVC                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   kubectl get pvc -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 2. Stop Outline                                                                                                                                                                                               
   kubectl scale deployment outline-outline --replicas=0 -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 3. Deploy helper pod (use the YAML from Step 3)                                                                                                                                                               
   kubectl apply -f restore-pod.yaml                                                                                                                                                                               
   kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready pod/outline-restore -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 4. Copy tar.gz                                                                                                                                                                                                
   kubectl cp ./outline-files.tar.gz outline-restore:/tmp/ -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 5. Extract                                                                                                                                                                                                    
   kubectl exec -it outline-restore -n <your-namespace> -- sh -c "cd /var/lib/outline/data && tar xzf /tmp/outline-files.tar.gz"                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 6. Verify                                                                                                                                                                                                     
   kubectl exec -it outline-restore -n <your-namespace> -- ls -la /var/lib/outline/data                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 7. Clean up helper                                                                                                                                                                                            
   kubectl delete pod outline-restore -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # 8. Start Outline                                                                                                                                                                                              
   kubectl scale deployment outline-outline --replicas=2 -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                       
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 What if Outline was never deployed before?                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 If the PVC doesn't exist yet because you haven't run helm install, just run helm install first — that creates the PVC. Then follow the restore steps above.                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 Quick alternative (skip the helper pod)                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 If you're feeling confident / in a hurry, you can do it directly on the Outline pod live:                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                           
   # Copy tar into running pod                                                                                                                                                                                     
   POD=$(kubectl get pod -n <your-namespace> -l app=outline -o jsonpath='{.items[0].metadata.name}')                                                                                                               
   kubectl cp ./outline-files.tar.gz "$POD:/tmp/" -n <your-namespace>                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
   # Extract inside                                                                                                                                                                                                
   kubectl exec -it "$POD" -n <your-namespace> -- sh -c "cd /var/lib/outline/data && tar xzf /tmp/outline-files.tar.gz"                                                                                            
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 ⚠️ Not recommended if Outline is actively serving users — the app might hold file locks while you overwrite.                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
